### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Qwerty123!"
}

### Register again — should be 409
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Qwerty123!"
}

### Missing password — should be 400
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nopassword@example.com"
}
